<h3 class="muted">Reservation & Check in</h3>
<div class="faq-block">
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>What are the check-in and check-out times?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Check-in starts from 15:00 & Check-out is until 11:00.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Can I request early check-in or early check-out?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer twolines d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Early check-in depends on availability, if possible we will accomodate it for you, while early check-out is always available.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Do you accept walk-in reservations?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Walk-ins are accepted depending on room availability on the same day.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>What is your cancellation policy?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Free cancellation is available within 3 hours of booking, after that, cancellation fees will apply.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>What payment methods do you accept?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>We accept major credit cards, cash, and selected digital payment methods.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Is there a deposit required?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Deposit is not required.</h6>
  </div>
</div>
